[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/931442464","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333#issuecomment-931442464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333","id":931442464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE843hK8g","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-30T15:45:07Z","updated_at":"2021-09-30T15:45:07Z","body":"Thanks for the submission, @g4s8.\r\n\r\nFor licenses that are requested to be added to the SPDX License List, we evaluate them according to the [License Inclusion Principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md).\r\n\r\nFrom a quick look, I'm inclined to say that the Oracle NFTC would likely _not_ qualify under the inclusion principles, particularly looking at the \"other factors\":\r\n1. it appears to be for binaries only (not source code, except as may incidentally be provided), prohibits modification, etc., so wouldn't qualify under the various open definitions\r\n2. it is set up for use by Oracle only, not general-use\r\n3. probably does have \"substantial use\" given the widespread use of OracleJDK\r\n4. doesn't appear to meet the \"free distribution of source code\" provision\r\n5. not clear on license steward's opinions on including it\r\n\r\nI'm certainly open to thoughts from others in the SPDX Legal community, but I'm inclined to say that this is the sort of single-product-use, non-FOSS license that typically doesn't qualify under the inclusion principles.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/931442464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/932542939","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333#issuecomment-932542939","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333","id":932542939,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE843lXnb","user":{"login":"seabass-labrax","id":79224200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjI0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79224200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax","html_url":"https://github.com/seabass-labrax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-01T20:52:18Z","updated_at":"2021-10-01T20:52:18Z","body":"@g4s8, thanks for opening this issue and welcome to @spdx! We always appreciate new licenses being brought to our attention.\n\nThat said, this license seems to be outside the scope of the SPDX Licence List for the reasons that @swinslow described above. Users of OracleJDK who want to create SPDX bill of materials can still do so using [the `LicenseRef-` prefix](https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/other-licensing-information-detected/#101-license-identifier-field/) even if this license isn't included in the SPDX License List :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/932542939/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/943552138","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333#issuecomment-943552138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1333","id":943552138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE844PXaK","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-14T17:07:49Z","updated_at":"2021-10-14T17:07:49Z","body":"agree with the above analysis re: not meeting the inclusion guidelines (and closing issue as such)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/943552138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]